====Noun====
{{ang-noun|n|g2=m}}

# [[peace]]
#* '''late 9th century''', [https://archive.org/details/kingalfredsorosi79oros/page/104/mode/2up translation] of [[w:Orosius|Orosius’]] ''History Against the Pagans''
#*: {{quote|ang|''Æfter þǣm þe Rōmeburg ġetimbred wæs IIII hunde wintra ⁊ II, þætte Cartaina þǣre burge ǣrendracan cōmon tō Rōme ⁊ him ġebudon þæt hīe '''frið''' him betwēonum hæfden...''|Four hundred and two years after the city of Rome was built, messengers [from]<!--the Latin source says ab Carthagine--> the city of Carthage came to Rome and proposed that there be '''peace''' between them...}}
